===============================================================================
Analysing of Changelogs shows the following:
Debian does not support robbo.ttf for legal reason, so why should we. 
-Deleted fonts.

Debian knows a bug with oily skin causing crashes for people.
(Debian #614042)
-Deleted oily.

Upstream introduced skins with v0.64 as a feature. 
Original: "Original GNU Robbo skin based on the Atari Robbo graphics."
-NOT_LEGAL
Oily: "… based on the orginal … graphics … oily effect."
-NOT_LEGAL
Tronic: "Newly created skin with some vintage science fiction influences."
-OK??
-Deleted wrong skins cause feature is not compatible with our policy.

Upstream introduced sound with v0.64 as a feature. 
-Deleted sounds and disabled support. Comply with policy.


